OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers across
OL,6,Feastern areas this morning, then
OL,7,Fgradually mostly dying away later.
OL,8,FFurther west remaining dry, with a
OL,9,Fsunny start then patchy cloud and
OL,10,Fsunny intervals. Breezy coastal
OL,11,Fconditions slowly ease.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMainly dry at first with long
OL,14,Fclear periods. Later in the night
OL,15,Fscattered showers arrive along the
OL,16,Fcoast, perhaps pushing showers a
OL,17,Flittle way inland. Becoming chilly,
OL,18,Fwith light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
